msgstr "小絹夾爪寶物"

msgid "A cosmetic only the claw can drop."
msgstr "只有夾爪才會掉落的裝扮。"

msgid "Collected — back to Day 1 tomorrow!"
msgstr "已領取 — 明天從第 1 天開始！"

msgid "CLAIM MY TREAT!"
msgstr "領取獎勵！"

msgid "CHECKING…"
msgstr "確認中…"

msgid "See you tomorrow!"
msgstr "明天見！"

msgid "Maybe later"
msgstr "等等再說"

msgid "Miss a day and the calendar restarts at Day 1."
msgstr "只要漏掉一天，就會從第 1 天重新開始。"

msgid "NEXT TREAT IN"
msgstr "距離下個獎勵"

msgid "NEXT TREAT"
msgstr "下個獎勵"

msgid "Next treat in %s"
msgstr "距離下個獎勵 %s"

msgid "Today's treat is ready!"
msgstr "今日獎勵已送達！"

msgid "DAILY TREAT READY"
msgstr "每日獎勵已送達"

msgid "Claim it!"
msgstr "快領取！"

msgid "Tap to open your reward"
msgstr "點一下打開獎勵"

msgid "Come back for your next treat"
msgstr "下個獎勵也別錯過"

msgid "A little prize is waiting!"
msgstr "小小獎勵正在等你！"

msgid "TREAT READY!"
msgstr "獎勵到了！"

msgid "Couldn't check your daily treat. Please try again while online."
msgstr "無法確認每日獎勵，請在連線狀態下再試一次。"

msgid "Kinu's everyday shape. Sturdy on every side."
msgstr "小絹的日常模樣，每一面都穩穩的。"

msgid "A flat, sleepy Kinu. The best base there is."
msgstr "扁扁又想睡的小絹，最棒的底座。"

msgid "Stretched out for a nap. Great for bridging gaps."
msgstr "伸長身子睡午覺，最適合填補空隙。"

msgid "Standing up proud. Saves space, but wobbles."
msgstr "驕傲地站著，很省空間，但會搖搖晃晃。"

msgid "Rolled into a ball. Loves to roll away."
msgstr "縮成一顆球，最愛滾來滾去。"

msgid "A mischievous forest spirit costume, tail included."
msgstr "調皮森林精靈裝，附尾巴。"

msgid "Soft, floppy ears for extra-snuggly hops."
msgstr "軟軟垂耳，蹦蹦跳跳好療癒。"

msgid "Tiny wings for a moonlit flutter."
msgstr "在月光下拍動的小翅膀。"

msgid "A clever bushy tail, always up to something."
msgstr "聰明的蓬鬆尾巴，總在打什麼主意。"

msgid "Cool, damp, and ready to leap."
msgstr "涼涼濕濕，隨時準備跳躍。"

msgid "A single leaf cap. Autumn's simplest gift."
msgstr "一片葉子帽，秋天最簡單的禮物。"

msgid "A tiny hat and an eyepatch for high-seas snacking."
msgstr "小帽子配眼罩，航海吃點心。"

msgid "Silent, stealthy, and sworn to protect the box."
msgstr "無聲無息，誓死守護盒子。"

msgid "Round, black-and-white, and endlessly huggable."
msgstr "圓滾滾黑白配，怎麼抱都抱不夠。"

msgid "Spiky and prehistoric, but still very cuddly."
msgstr "尖刺刺的史前生物，但還是很好抱。"

msgid "A snug little helmet for space-bound snacking."
msgstr "合身的小頭盔，帶著點心去太空。"

msgid "A friendly boo under a floaty sheet."
msgstr "飄飄床單下，友善地「哇！」一聲。"

msgid "All fin, no bite. Promise."
msgstr "只有魚鰭，不會咬人，保證。"

msgid "Sweet, red, and freckled with seeds."
msgstr "甜甜紅紅，點綴著小籽。"

msgid "Bold stripes for a fierce little roar."
msgstr "大膽的條紋，小小聲地吼一下。"

msgid "Curled horns and a proud little tail."
msgstr "捲捲的角，還有驕傲的小尾巴。"

msgid "A warm woodgrain finish, carved with care."
msgstr "用心雕刻的溫暖木紋。"

msgid "Cool swirls of stone, polished smooth."
msgstr "磨得光滑的冰涼石紋。"

msgid "Faceted and glinting like cut glass."
msgstr "像切割玻璃一樣閃閃發亮。"

msgid "A little pocket of starlight, swirled in."
msgstr "把一小口星光捲了進去。"

msgid "Gleaming and precious, fit for a treasure box."
msgstr "閃亮珍貴，最適合寶箱。"

msgid "Plain cypress wood, warm and simple."
msgstr "樸素溫暖的檜木。"

msgid "Woven slats that smell faintly of rice."
msgstr "淡淡飄著米香的竹編蒸籠。"

msgid "Glossy red lacquer, polished to a mirror shine."
msgstr "磨得像鏡子一樣光亮的朱紅漆器。"

msgid "Painted with drifting cherry blossom petals."
msgstr "畫滿飄落的櫻花花瓣。"

msgid "Cool, solid stone, worn smooth over time."
msgstr "歲月磨圓的冰涼堅石。"

msgid "Gilded edges fit for a treasure hoard."
msgstr "鑲金邊，適合裝滿寶藏。"

msgid "The cosy little shop where it all began."
msgstr "一切開始的溫馨小店。"

msgid "Lanterns and stalls, glowing long after sundown."
msgstr "日落後依然明亮的燈籠與攤位。"

msgid "A frosty hush and a blanket of fresh snow."
msgstr "寂靜的霜寒，覆上一層新雪。"

msgid "A lane lined with blossoms, petals drifting on the breeze."
msgstr "花瓣隨風飄落的櫻花小巷。"

msgid "Fresh from the shell, still a little wobbly."
msgstr "剛破殼而出，還有點搖搖晃晃。"

msgid "Wrapped up snug, ready to be delivered with love."
msgstr "包得緊緊的，準備帶著愛送達。"

msgid "A tiny towel for a well-earned soak."
msgstr "辛苦後泡湯用的小毛巾。"

msgid "A neat little rice pillow, nori sash and all."
msgstr "繫上海苔腰帶的整齊小飯枕。"

msgid "Buzzing stripes and see-through little wings."
msgstr "嗡嗡條紋配上透明小翅膀。"

msgid "Round, lucky, and always bouncing back."
msgstr "圓圓的很吉利，跌倒了總會站起來。"

msgid "A cheerful octopus cap with dangling little legs."
msgstr "垂著小腳的開心章魚帽。"

msgid "A river spirit's dish-shaped cap, kept nice and damp."
msgstr "保持濕潤的河童盤子帽。"

msgid "A humble woven basket, sturdy and simple."
msgstr "樸素又結實的編織籃。"

msgid "Peppermint stripes, sweet enough to lick."
msgstr "甜到想舔一口的薄荷條紋。"

msgid "Ribboned shut, like a present waiting to be opened."
msgstr "綁上緞帶，等著被打開的禮物。"

msgid "Stacked lacquered tiers for a New Year's feast."
msgstr "新年大餐用的層層漆器便當盒。"

msgid "Cool and glassy, like it was carved from a glacier."
msgstr "冰涼透亮，彷彿從冰川雕出來。"

msgid "Buzzing with electric colour, straight off the arcade floor."
msgstr "從遊樂場直送的電光色彩。"

msgid "Tall green stalks swaying in a gentle hush."
msgstr "高高的青竹在寧靜中搖曳。"

msgid "Red leaves settling over old wooden eaves."
msgstr "紅葉輕輕落在古老的木屋簷上。"

msgid "Steam rising off a warm, mineral-scented bath."
msgstr "溫暖的溫泉上冒著熱氣。"

msgid "Paper lanterns, drumbeats, and the smell of grilled snacks."
msgstr "紙燈籠、太鼓聲，還有烤小吃的香味。"

msgid "A quiet platform for watching the full moon rise."
msgstr "靜靜欣賞滿月升起的賞月台。"

msgid "A skyline glowing pink and blue after dark."
msgstr "入夜後閃耀粉紅與藍光的天際線。"

msgid "Nine tails' worth of old, playful magic."
msgstr "九條尾巴份量的古老調皮魔法。"

msgid "Feathers that glow like the last embers of a fire."
msgstr "像餘燼般發光的羽毛。"

msgid "A single spiralled horn and a shimmering mane."
msgstr "一根螺旋角配上閃亮鬃毛。"

msgid "One paw raised, calling good fortune your way."
msgstr "舉起一隻爪，把好運招過來。"

msgid "A small suit of armour, worn with quiet pride."
msgstr "帶著沉穩驕傲穿上的小盔甲。"

msgid "Rippling scales in the colours of a garden pond."
msgstr "閃著庭園池塘色彩的粼粼魚鱗。"

msgid "Frilly gills and a permanent, gummy smile."
msgstr "荷葉邊鰓和永遠的憨笑。"

msgid "A sash-tied robe patterned for a festival stroll."
msgstr "繫上腰帶、適合逛祭典的和服。"

msgid "Small horns and a grin that's more mischief than menace."
msgstr "小角配上比起嚇人更像調皮的笑容。"

msgid "Unbothered, citrus-scented, and perfectly zen."
msgstr "什麼都不在意，帶著柚子香的完美禪意。"

