msgstr "睡帽"

msgid "Downy yellow fluff, fresh out of the nest."
msgstr "剛離巢的黃色絨毛。"

msgid "A curled tail and the world's proudest grin."
msgstr "捲捲尾巴，世界上最得意的笑容。"

msgid "Patchwork fur and a whole lot of purring."
msgstr "拼布般的毛色和滿滿的呼嚕聲。"

msgid "Sticky-pawed and always sniffing out something sweet."
msgstr "爪子黏黏的，總在嗅著甜食。"

msgid "Cheeks stuffed full, just in case."
msgstr "以防萬一，臉頰塞得滿滿的。"

msgid "A waddly little tuxedo, fresh off the ice."
msgstr "剛從冰上走來的搖擺小燕尾服。"

msgid "Soft yellow down and a very determined waddle."
msgstr "柔軟黃絨毛，走得搖搖擺擺卻很堅定。"

msgid "Round, smooth, and built entirely for flopping."
msgstr "圓圓滑滑，天生就是用來躺平的。"

msgid "A floaty little paddler with a taste for snacks."
msgstr "愛吃點心的漂浮划水小高手。"

msgid "A rusty coat and a tail made for wrapping up warm."
msgstr "鏽紅色毛皮，尾巴正好拿來保暖。"

msgid "A speckled forest-floor cap, sprouted overnight."
msgstr "一夜之間冒出來的斑點森林蘑菇帽。"

msgid "Blushed pink and irresistibly soft."
msgstr "泛著粉紅，軟得讓人受不了。"

msgid "Zesty, sunny, and a little bit sour."
msgstr "清爽明亮，還帶點微酸。"

msgid "Frosted on top with a cherry for good measure."
msgstr "頂上抹滿糖霜，再加一顆櫻桃。"

msgid "Wobbly, caramel-topped, and endlessly jiggly."
msgstr "淋上焦糖，一直抖個不停。"

msgid "Milky sweetness with tapioca pearls sinking to the bottom."
msgstr "香甜奶味，珍珠沉在杯底。"

msgid "A crackly sugar crust over a soft, sweet bun."
msgstr "酥脆糖皮包著鬆軟香甜的麵包。"

msgid "Glazed, ringed, and scattered with sprinkles."
msgstr "亮晶晶的圈圈，撒滿彩色糖粒。"

msgid "Pillowy soft and ready for the campfire."
msgstr "像枕頭一樣鬆軟，準備好去營火旁。"

msgid "A warm fish-shaped cake, filled with something sweet."
msgstr "包著甜餡、熱呼呼的魚形點心。"

msgid "A puff of soft, drifting sky."
msgstr "一團輕輕飄動的柔軟天空。"

msgid "A little points-and-all night-sky sparkle."
msgstr "連尖角都閃閃發亮的夜空小星光。"

msgid "A crescent cap for the drowsiest of Kinu."
msgstr "給最想睡的小絹戴的新月帽。"

msgid "Bright petals that always face the light."
msgstr "永遠朝著光的明亮花瓣。"

msgid "A ring of little white blooms, woven by hand."
msgstr "親手編成的小白花圈。"

msgid "A crisp collar and cap for smooth sailing."
msgstr "筆挺的領子和帽子，一帆風順。"

msgid "A cheerful yellow slicker for splashing through puddles."
msgstr "踩水窪用的開心黃色雨衣。"

msgid "Cosy dungarees with a pocketful of berries."
msgstr "口袋裝滿莓果的舒適吊帶褲。"

msgid "A paint-splattered smock and a beret, tilted just so."
msgstr "沾滿顏料的畫袍，配上斜斜的貝雷帽。"

msgid "A soft nightcap for the cosiest of naps."
msgstr "最舒服的午睡要戴的柔軟睡帽。"

msgid "Magical Kinu"
msgstr "魔法小絹"

msgid "Moon Princess"
msgstr "月亮公主"

msgid "Candy Witch"
msgstr "糖果女巫"

msgid "Celestial Bunny"
msgstr "星空兔"

msgid "Sakura Deer"
msgstr "櫻花鹿"

msgid "Frog Prince"
msgstr "青蛙王子"

msgid "Pastel Dragon"
msgstr "粉彩龍"

msgid "Snow Fox"
msgstr "雪狐"

msgid "Dream Jellyfish"
msgstr "夢幻水母"

msgid "Kinu Fairy"
msgstr "小絹精靈"

msgid "A sparkling bow and a wand full of wishes."
msgstr "閃亮蝴蝶結和裝滿願望的魔杖。"

msgid "A silvery gown fit for ruling the night sky."
msgstr "足以統治夜空的銀色禮服。"

msgid "A pointed hat stitched from spun sugar."
msgstr "用棉花糖縫成的尖帽子。"

msgid "Starlit ears that shimmer under a midnight sky."
msgstr "在午夜星空下閃耀的星光耳朵。"

msgid "Little antlers dusted in drifting cherry blossom."
msgstr "沾著飄落櫻花的小鹿角。"

msgid "A tiny crown, just in case that kiss works."
msgstr "小小王冠，以防那個吻真的有效。"

msgid "A candy-coloured dragon, all softness and no fire."
msgstr "糖果色的龍，軟綿綿又不噴火。"

msgid "A frost-white coat, silent as falling snow."
msgstr "像落雪般安靜的霜白毛皮。"

msgid "Trailing tendrils that glow like a lullaby."
msgstr "像搖籃曲般發光的飄逸觸手。"

msgid "Gossamer wings and a sprinkle of pixie dust."
msgstr "薄紗翅膀，再撒一點精靈粉。"

msgid "Builder Helmet"
msgstr "工地安全帽"

msgid "Balance Pole"
msgstr "平衡桿"

msgid "Shoyu Chef"
msgstr "醬油主廚"

msgid "Festival Yukata"
msgstr "祭典浴衣"

msgid "Mountain Climber"
msgstr "登山家"

msgid "Lucky Charm"
msgstr "幸運御守"

msgid "A bright hard hat and reflective vest for Kinu who mean business."
msgstr "給認真小絹的亮色安全帽和反光背心。"

msgid "A cheerful performer’s sash and a pole for improbable stacks."
msgstr "開心的特技表演腰帶，配上用來疊出奇蹟的長桿。"

msgid "A tall chef’s toque for a true master of sticky stacking."
msgstr "給黏黏疊疊真正大師的高高主廚帽。"

msgid "A midnight-blue summer robe with hanabi across the cloth."
msgstr "布料上綻放煙火的深夜藍夏日浴衣。"

msgid "A red beanie, tiny pack and plenty of summit spirit."
msgstr "紅毛帽、小背包，滿滿的登頂精神。"

msgid "A little bell and golden star charms for fortunate Kinu."
msgstr "給幸運小絹的小鈴鐺和金星御守。"

msgid "Jelly Cube"
msgstr "果凍方塊"

msgid "Rose Delight"
msgstr "玫瑰軟糖"

msgid "Chocolate Square"
msgstr "巧克力磚"

msgid "Burger Stack"
msgstr "漢堡塔"

msgid "Joyful Snack Box"
msgstr "歡樂點心盒"

msgid "Sunny Sea Sponge"
msgstr "陽光海綿"

msgid "Bread Loaf"
msgstr "吐司"

msgid "Bouncy, wobbly, and topped with a glossy jelly dome."
msgstr "Q彈晃動，頂著亮晶晶的果凍圓頂。"

msgid "A soft pink sweet dusted in fragrant rose sugar."
msgstr "撒上芬芳玫瑰糖的粉紅軟糖。"

msgid "Six neat little chocolate tiles, ready to snap apart."
msgstr "六塊整齊小巧克力，隨時可以掰開。"

msgid "A sesame bun, leafy lettuce and a very tidy patty."
msgstr "芝麻麵包、生菜，還有一塊很整齊的肉排。"

msgid "A bright little takeaway box with a fry-shaped crown."
msgstr "戴著薯條王冠的鮮豔外帶盒。"

msgid "A porous yellow friend in square trousers and a tiny red tie."
msgstr "穿方形褲子、打小紅領帶的多孔黃色朋友。"

msgid "A warm crust, soft centre and three fresh-baked score marks."
msgstr "溫熱外皮、鬆軟內裡，還有三道剛烤好的刀痕。"

msgid "Cracks mended in gold, more beautiful for the break."
msgstr "用金修補裂痕，破碎後更美麗。"

msgid "Iron-banded and brimming with pirate's gold."
msgstr "鐵箍箱子裡裝滿海盜黃金。"

msgid "Split open to reveal a crystal-studded heart."
msgstr "剖開後露出滿是水晶的內心。"

msgid "A round plastic shell, twisted open for a surprise."
msgstr "轉開圓圓的扭蛋殼，會有什麼驚喜呢？"

msgid "A festival drum, painted red and ready to boom."
msgstr "漆成紅色、準備咚咚響的祭典太鼓。"

msgid "Layered sponge and cream, one strawberry short of perfect."
msgstr "海綿蛋糕與奶油層層疊，只差一顆草莓就完美了。"

msgid "A deep blue box scattered with tiny constellations."
msgstr "點綴著小星座的深藍色盒子。"

msgid "Rippling water with koi drifting just beneath the surface."
msgstr "水波盪漾，錦鯉在水面下悠游。"

msgid "Soft and puffed up, like it drifted down from the sky."
msgstr "軟綿綿鼓鼓的，像從天上飄下來。"

msgid "Inlaid shell that shimmers with every tilt of the light."
msgstr "每次傾斜都閃著光的螺鈿貝殼。"

msgid "Blinking lights and the chime of a claw machine."
msgstr "閃爍燈光和夾娃娃機的音效。"

msgid "A hall beneath the sea, glittering with dragon treasure."
msgstr "海底宮殿裡閃耀著龍的寶藏。"

msgid "A quiet dome overlooking the grey lunar dust."
msgstr "俯瞰灰色月塵的寧靜圓頂。"

msgid "A shrine perched above the clouds, ropes and bells swaying."
msgstr "雲端上的神社，繩索和鈴鐺輕輕搖晃。"

msgid "Rolling green rows with a mountain standing watch."
msgstr "高山守望著起伏的綠色茶田。"

msgid "A landscape built entirely from sugar and sponge."
msgstr "完全用糖和海綿蛋糕打造的風景。"

msgid "Snow lit up in ribbons of green and violet."
msgstr "被綠色與紫色光帶照亮的雪原。"

msgid "Warm sand, gentle waves, and a striped parasol."
msgstr "溫暖沙灘、輕柔海浪和條紋陽傘。"

msgid "Paper lanterns drifting downstream on quiet water."
msgstr "紙燈籠在靜靜的水面上順流而下。"

msgid "Stone towers and banners snapping in the wind."
msgstr "石塔與迎風飄揚的旗幟。"

msgid "A rice-ball cap with a neat nori patch."
msgstr "貼著整齊海苔的飯糰帽。"

